<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 20.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 20.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield   Close</p>
<p> 1 Prime Credit Tr	10.10    0.97</p>
<p> 2 Schroder Intl	  10.02    2.40</p>
<p> 3 MT Leyshon Gold	10.00    2.50</p>
<p> 4 Villa World	    10.00    1.10</p>
<p> 5 Prop Income Inv	 9.68    1.05</p>
<p> 6 BT Prop Trust	   9.54    1.71</p>
<p> 7 Colonial Mutual	 9.45    1.10</p>
