<p> 9 Centro Prop	     8.94    2.18</p>
<p>10 Aust Tour		 8.93    0.84</p>
<p>11 Gandel Retail Tr	8.86    0.88</p>
<p>12 Barclays Mirvac	 8.53    0.00</p>
<p>13 Schroder Prop	   8.53    2.17</p>
<p>14 Equitilink		8.47    0.59</p>
